# Logos and the files menu to a new game (the last cross again in case the game was slow to show
# Yes), the intro skipped by holding options (once more in the loading screen, where it does
# nothing, in case the first came before the intro), then Slumbering Streets: hops right, each
# third one back left first so a fall into the pit before the tall block climbs out again; the wall
# that opens to the violin played by its gramophone; on to the curtain, opened by holding triangle at
# the gramophone left of it; through it to the next street, where the tall step is climbed by a jump
# and the bow's bounce (r2) just before landing, on until the spikes. The stick stays held between
# hops: the bounce off the roses before the statue's ledge clears it only with right held to landing.
